NAME
       tty - print the name of the terminal

SYNOPSIS
       tty [-s]

DESCRIPTION
       Print the name of the terminal on standard input. Exit
       status: 0 a terminal, 1 not a terminal, 2 usage error.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

